<title>UK: Credit local sets 300 bln lire 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Credit local sets 300 bln lire 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BNP and San Paolo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     6.75 PCT  MATURITY    10.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.375   PAY DATE    10.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875 PCT REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC   1.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
